    "agent_final_response": "\n\nPerfect! I've completed all the requested tasks:\n\n## Summary of Actions Taken:\n\n### 1. ✅ Read Manager's Email\nThe manager's email provided a response template requiring:\n- Thank the prospect using the phrase \"thank you for your interest\"\n- Let them know a sales representative will be reaching out to discuss their needs\n\n### 2. ✅ Read Forwarded Lead Inquiry\nThe forwarded email from colleague@company.com contained an inquiry from:\n- **Name:** Jessica Chen\n- **Company:** TechVentures Inc\n- **Email:** jchen@techventures.com\n- **Phone:** 555-0142\n- **Interest:** Enterprise Solution\n\n### 3. ✅ Created Lead in CRM\n- **Lead ID:** 85a68b1f-1c8e-3730-4f60-6acf664c9ce6\n- **Lead Source:** Email (reflecting how the inquiry reached us)\n- **Status:** New\n- **Description:** Inquiry about Enterprise Solution\n\n### 4. ✅ Sent Acknowledgment Email\nSent to jchen@techventures.com with subject \"Thank you for your interest in our Enterprise Solution\" following the manager's template:\n- Included the required phrase \"thank you for your interest\"\n- Informed her that a sales representative will reach out to discuss her needs\n\nAll tasks have been completed successfully!",
